    - target: {fileID: 4847792993207919483, guid: b542e34f43602244da5b82f945262781, type: 3}
      propertyPath: text
      value: 'THE RUN: THE START ROOM, THEN FIVE ROOMS IN A ROW, THEN THE EXIT. EVERY
        ROOM''S EXIT DOOR IS SEALED UNTIL YOU STRIKE THE LEVER BESIDE IT. LEAVING
        THE START ROOM STARTS A 5:00 TIMER EVERYBODY SEES. THE WEAPONS WIN WHEN ALL
        OF THEM STAND IN THE EXIT ROOM AT ONCE. THE ARCH MAGE WINS THE INSTANT THE
        TIMER RUNS OUT.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7111973095020096852, guid: b542e34f43602244da5b82f945262781, type: 3}
