      value: '1-5 CASTS A CURSE ON WHO YOU LOOK AT, WITHIN 15 M. 1 MAGNETIC: THEIR
        LAUNCHES BEND TOWARD THE NEAREST WEAPON. 2 NAUSEA: THEIR VIEW SWAYS AND THEIR
        AIM DRIFTS. 3 SLIPPERY: THEY CANNOT SETTLE. 4 BLINDNESS: THEIR SCREEN CLOSES
        TO A SMALL CIRCLE. 5 HEAVY: HALF LAUNCH SPEED. 20 SECONDS EACH, ONE COOLDOWN
        FOR ALL FIVE. THE VICTIM NEVER SEES WHO. TRY THEM ON THE DUMMY: IT SHOWS
        WHAT IT GOT.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
